# Gentle AI
before SDD, reviews, or delegated work.

## Receipt-driven development

On. Will switch: `gentle-ai review mode enable|disable|status --cwd <repo>`

Before a generated review lifecycle, run:

`gentle-ai review status --cwd <repo> --contract gentle-ai.review-integration/v2 --next-transition`

Route only from `next_transition`. Never invent PASS or start `review start` unless that transition names it.

## Implementation routing

One route per change:
- Direct inline: 1-3 files, already understood
- Delegated direct: 4+ file exploration or 2+ non-trivial writes
- SDD: Opt-in only when explicitly requested
